{
  "_comment": [
    "Qwen-Image-2.1 setting image generator — compatible with H3 REF2VA requirements.",
    "",
    "Setting image types:",
    "  A) Character card:  16:9  (1920x1080 recommended, prompt should request widescreen layout)",
    "  B) Scene card:      16:9  (same as character card, no people/crowds/silhouettes)",
    "  C) Keyframe:        follow target video ratio (e.g., 9:16 = 1088x1920 for portrait shorts)",
    "",
    "Key design points:",
    "  - TextEncodeQwenImage21 outputs its own latent (slot 2) → no EmptyLatentImage needed.",
    "  - Reference images (up to 16 slots) connect to image_1..image_16 for identity consistency.",
    "  - ResolutionSelector(70) is provided as an unconnected helper for Agent-layer dimension calculations.",
    "  - Spectrum acceleration(4) and KV cache(5) are conditional based on registry config.",
    "",
    "ComfyUI nodes used (all native or from registry-listed packs):",
    "  UNETLoader, CLIPLoader(type=qwen_image), VAELoader, TextEncodeQwenImage21,",
    "  KSampler, VAEDecode, SaveImage, ResolutionSelector, QwenImage21Cache, SpectrumQwenImage21"
  ],

  "1": {
    "class_type": "UNETLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "unet_name": "{{UNET_NAME}}",
      "weight_dtype": "default"
    }
  },

  "2": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "clip_name": "{{CLIP_NAME}}",
      "type": "qwen_image",
      "device": "default"
    }
  },

  "3": {
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "inputs": {
      "vae_name": "{{VAE_NAME}}"
    }
  },

  "4": {
    "_cond": { "include_if": "spectrum == True" },
    "class_type": "SpectrumQwenImage21",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["1", 0],
      "warmup_steps": 5,
      "tail_actual_steps": 2,
      "window_size": 2.0,
      "flex_window": 0.75,
      "max_consecutive_forecasts": 8,
      "history_points": 8,
      "chebyshev_degree": 4,
      "ridge_lambda": 0.1,
      "blend_weight": 0.5,
      "cache_device": "main_device",
      "force_actual_on_control": true,
      "debug": false
    }
  },

  "5": {
    "_cond": { "include_if": "cache == True" },
    "class_type": "QwenImage21Cache",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["4", 0],
      "device": "auto",
      "dtype": "default"
    }
  },

  "10": {
    "class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImage21",
    "inputs": {
      "clip": ["2", 0],
      "prompt": "{{PROMPT}}",
      "negative_prompt": "{{NEGATIVE_PROMPT}}",
      "vae": ["3", 0],
      "resolution": "{{RESOLUTION}}"
    }
  },

  "20": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["5", 0],
      "positive": ["10", 0],
      "negative": ["10", 1],
      "latent_image": ["10", 2],
      "seed": "{{SEED}}",
      "steps": "{{STEPS}}",
      "cfg": "{{CFG}}",
      "sampler_name": "{{SAMPLER}}",
      "scheduler": "{{SCHEDULER}}",
      "denoise": 1.0
    }
  },

  "30": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": ["20", 0],
      "vae": ["3", 0]
    }
  },

  "40": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "inputs": {
      "images": ["30", 0],
      "filename_prefix": "{{JOB_ID}}"
    }
  }
}
